Lori is excited to buy a $320.00 pair of shoes and a matching belt that is $32.00. Her part-time job pays her $8.00 an hour. How many hours will she have to work before she can make her purchase?,Lori wants to buy a $320.00 pair of shoes and a matching belt that is $32.00. Her part-time job pays her $8.00 an hour. How many hours will she have to work before she can make her purchase?,44,44,44,44,"Let me solve this step by step.

